00:04:26.349 --> 00:04:29.727
(team cheering)

00:04:29.727 --> 00:04:30.645
- UST, UST,

00:04:32.146 --> 00:04:33.606
UST, UST!

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:34.607
- [Team] UST, UST!

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:35.775
UST, UST, UST!

00:04:37.527 --> 00:04:38.695
UST, UST, UST.

00:04:42.824 --> 00:04:44.117
- We're trading a bit below a dollar.

00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:46.577
We're at 0.998 now.

00:04:46.577 --> 00:04:47.829
